        "description": "Residents evacuated from the devastated Russian-occupied city of Oleshky have arrived in Belarus and are expected back in Ukraine later on Saturday, authorities have said.\n\nThey were taken out on Friday during a local ceasefire brokered by US First Lady Melania Trump.\n\nPlanes carrying Oleshky residents landed in the city of Gomel on Saturday morning, according to Belarusian state media and a senior Ukrainian official.\n\nSubscribe to our channel here: https://bbc.in/bbcnews\n\nFor the latest news download the BBC News app or visit BBC.com/news\n\n#Oleshky #Ukraine #Belarus #BBCNews",
